BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cookie Queens
DTSTART:20260517T180000Z
DTEND:20260517T194500Z
DTSTAMP:20260517T180000Z
UID:vM6A4LaGs2
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 91 mins (1h31m)\n\nThis charming SXSW Film & TV Fest
 ival Audience Award-winning documentary profiles four resolute girls throu
 gh Girl Scout Cookie season as they find their place in the $800 million p
 henomenon.Executive Producer Steve Hall and Co-Producer Ann Rogers schedul
 ed to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/cookie-queens\n\nEstimated 
 start: 11:10
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Big Cheese
DTSTART:20260517T203000Z
DTEND:20260517T222500Z
DTSTAMP:20260517T203000Z
UID:KW868SHcr1
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 101 mins (1h41m)\n\nAdam “Mr. Moo” Moskowitz is 
 on a mission to make the world take American cheesemongers seriously. For 
 over a decade\, he’s led a team of eccentric misfits to the Olympics of 
 Cheese\, where Team USA has never won. Could this be their year? Director 
 Sara Joe Wolansky and Subjects Courtney Johnson & Adam Moskowitz schedul
 ed to attend. After the film on Sat\, May 16\, pass and ticket-holders ca
 n head over to Tin Lizzie for an udderly delicious cheese tasting\, courte
 sy of Street Cheese and Peterson Cheese\, with custom wine pairings availa
 ble for purchase. It will surely stink. Wink.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/fest
 ival/the-big-cheese\n\nEstimated start: 13:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Love Chaos Kin
DTSTART:20260517T231500Z
DTEND:20260518T010500Z
DTSTAMP:20260517T231500Z
UID:85qO1ybSAD
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nAn Indian immigrant couple adopts
  twins of Navajo descent and stays connected to the biological family. Lov
 e Chaos Kin is a clear-eyed look at what belonging to more than one world 
 actually means. Director Chithra Jeyaram scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://w
 ww.siff.net/festival/love-chaos-kin\n\nEstimated start: 16:25
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Edie Arnold is a Loser
DTSTART:20260518T020000Z
DTEND:20260518T034500Z
DTSTAMP:20260518T020000Z
UID:HhSTxWytqr
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 87 mins (1h27m)\n\nLace up your combat boots and whi
 p out that black eyeliner for Edie Arnold is a Loser\, an infectiously cha
 rming coming-of-age flick about a self-proclaimed loser starting a punk ba
 nd at her Catholic high school. Directors Kade Atwood and Megan Rico sched
 uled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/edie-arnold-is-a-loser\n\
 nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
